  "description": "Dive into the holiday season with a modern twist with “Pop Art Christmas,” a seamless pattern collection that brings a pop art sensibility to traditional Christmas motifs. Featuring bold colors and contemporary designs, these patterns are perfect for standout seasonal decor, unique gift wrapping, or festive apparel. Add a splash of pop art cheer to your holiday projects and celebrate in style!\nKey Features:\n12″ x 12″ patterns perfect for a variety of uses\nHigh-resolution 300 DPI for vibrant, clear prints\nSeamless design ensures continuous festive flair",
